	(text "STATUS / CHANNEL LEDs\nIO16 -> R401 330R series resistor -> WS2812B chain D401 ... D418\nChain order = LED index in firmware (D401 = index 0, D418 = index 17)\nRow 1: D401-D408 (index 0-7)\nRow 2: D409/D410 (index 8-9, status)\nRow 3: D411-D418 (index 10-17)\nC401-C418: 100n decoupling, one per LED, C419 10µ bulk"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
